  "synopsis": "Korra is the next Avatar after Aang, and she quickly mastered the elements of Water, Earth, and Fire. Now she must learn the element of Air. The only one who can teach her is Tenzin, Aang's son. To do this, Korra sets off to the Republic City, which is a center where all nations live together. Soon, Korra will have to face the so-called Equalists, a group of people who do not control the elements and want to take that ability away from others. At their head is Amon, who can strip others of their elemental control. Korra will have to find a way to stop them, and she will be helped by new friends – Firebender Mako, Earthbender Bolin, and inventor Asami Sato.",
